  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Localised generated text: accessible state words, glyph-button names, pager and carousel summaries, built-in button labels and dialog defaults now come from SheryStrings, with English and Persian built in and ISheryStringProvider for other languages. Fixes the SheryLoading spinner (and SheryBusyArea and the data table overlay) drawing nothing, right-to-left thumbs, sliders and popovers on Windows, and SheryComboBox, SheryTabControl and SheryRibbon overwriting a view model's selection. Controls no longer build hidden parts, and hidden animations stop. SheryProgressBar.ProgressText is now drawn, and SheryPersianCalendar follows the reading direction. Requires Microsoft.Maui.Controls 10.0.120 or later. Full notes in CHANGELOG.md.",
